  "description": "New to the Market - 3 bedroom bungalow style residence standing on a superb c 0.32 acre private site with lake views,situated in the beautiful River side Village of Finea. The area surrounded by lakes - Lough Sheelin and Lough Kinale is renowed for its  fishing and a haven for lovers of the outdoors.\n\nThe village which has retained its charm over the years, boasts a primary school, Church, Shop and two pubs and regular bus service to local larger towns. The bungalow is well presented with a good sized Kitchen/utility, sitting room with patio doors to the garden and 3 bedrooms. Recent modernisation to the property includes complete rewiring throughout and new flooring. \n\nThe property is presented in excellent condition and ready to live in. Vacant property Grants availble to extend/renovate the property further \n\n This property has plenty to offer the discerning purchaser and comes highly recommended by the agent",
